(text "U6100 keeps the 15 analog-switch SEL loads off the low-current AUP startup buffer.\nSTARTUP_READY_H adds one LVC input only: worst static load 18 uA < 20 uA.\nExisting startup/reset topology and no-automatic-rearm behavior are preserved." (at 15.24 104.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9b3d333e-9ee8-41db-9e1f-6180f7ad4c63"))
